                        "review": "RTS (Real Time Strategy) game.\r\nIt’s easy to learn and entertaining, but it can get repetitive. Most of the game you spend your time building up a large force and then pushing through the entire map, wiping everything out as you go. Pretty straightforward, nothing fancy, but still fun. I’d recommend picking it up on sale.\r\n\r\nSound – Music and sound effects are fitting.\r\nVisuals – Nothing to boast about.\r\nGameplay – Easy to learn, but can be repetitive.\r\nControls – Not a fan of the mouse buttons or the way the screen pans while trying to highlight units.\r\nReplay Value – Moderate.\r\n\r\nWould I recommend this game: Yes\r\nWhat do I rate this game: 4/5\r\n",
